00:21:15.170 --> 00:21:20.120
Well, I introduced my grandma and her friends to extreme shuffleboard.

00:21:20.320 --> 00:21:22.380
And they got mad at you?

00:21:22.940 --> 00:21:23.800
No, not at all.

00:21:23.880 --> 00:21:24.720
They loved the idea.

00:21:25.230 --> 00:21:26.950
But those grannies play rough.

00:21:27.710 --> 00:21:29.270
See you next time.

00:21:31.470 --> 00:21:31.670
Thank you.
